  <section class="hero grid-overlay">
    <div class="container hero-wrap">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Labour management made simple</div>
        <h1>Mazdoor Attendance<br>App jo <span class="accent">Easy</span> bhi hai<br>aur Accurate bhi</h1>
        <p>
          Site par attendance ka record sahi na ho to payment me confusion hota hai. Thekedaari mazdoor attendance app ke through
          full day, half day, site wise presence, worker ledger aur mazdoori calculations ko digital format me maintain karna easy ho jata hai.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Register Free</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://thekedaari.com/register/contractor-management-software">See Full System</a>
