                <div>Site: Badi Road House</div>
                <a class="install-btn" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Mark attendance</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="dashboard-grid">
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Present</small><strong>28</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Half Day</small><strong>4</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Absent</small><strong>2</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Pending Wages</small><strong>₹9,400</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="features">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Attendance system jo site ke hisaab se bana ho</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Ye page labour attendance keyword ke liye optimized hai. Content worker attendance aur wages workflow par focused hai.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">📍</div><h3>Site Wise Attendance</h3><p>Har project ya site par kaun worker aaya, kitne din aaya aur kis rate par payment banti hai — sab structured records me.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">🧮</div><h3>Attendance to Payment Link</h3><p>Attendance ka data directly wages aur worker ledger ko support karta hai, jisse payment calculation easy hoti hai.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">📋</div><h3>Clean Worker History</h3><p>Past attendance records dekh kar disputes aur confusion dono kam hote hain.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="why">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Manual attendance register ki problems</h3>
        <p>
          Paper register ya WhatsApp notes me attendance rakhne se frequently data miss ho jata hai. Month end par wages nikalte waqt confusion hota hai,
          worker ko lagta hai days kam likhe gaye, aur contractor ko past history jaldi milti nahi. Mazdoor attendance app se ye issue resolve hota hai.
        </p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Full day / half day support</li>
          <li>Worker wise attendance history</li>
          <li>Site wise labour reports</li>
          <li>Easy mobile entries</li>
          <li>Daily record consistency</li>
          <li>Payment calculations support</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Kis kis ke liye useful hai?</h3>
        <p>
          Agar aap contractor ho, thekedaar ho, site supervisor ho ya aap labour teams manage karte ho, to ye app aapke roz ke kaam ko streamline karta hai.
          Chhoti team ho ya multiple sites — dono me kaam aata hai.
        </p>
        <div class="kpis">
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Fast</strong><span>Daily marking</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Accurate</strong><span>Worker records</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Clear</strong><span>Wage linkage</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Simple</strong><span>Mobile use</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="how">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Attendance app ka simple flow</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Is process ko field staff bhi asaani se follow kar sakte hain.</p>
      <div class="panel" style="text-align:left; margin-top:22px;">
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><h4>Workers add karo</h4><p>Worker naam, rate aur project details save karo.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><h4>Roz attendance mark karo</h4><p>Full day, half day ya absent status ke saath records maintain karo.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><h4>Wages aur ledger monitor karo</h4><p>Attendance ke basis par payment aur balance track karo.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <div class="cta-wrap">
          <div>
            <h2>Mazdoor attendance ko digital banana hai?</h2>
            <p>Thekedaari try karo aur worker presence, wages aur site history ko one app me maintain karo.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="nav-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Start Free</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://thekedaari.com/construction-hisaab-kitab">See Hisaab Page</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

